      ],
      "image": "assets/images/19834/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine evaporated milk, condensed milk, and whipped topping in a blender and blend in pieces of bread until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/e0eTjXA3EUQxnLLcCcf9GAHhBrs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/19834-kulfi-VAT-006-step-02-2-0cf9a1a4ffab47759258b04c2ca57b08.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/19834/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour mixture into a 9x13-inch baking dish or two plastic ice cube trays, sprinkle with cardamom.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/AujtV29SPmu_zj-0w5jD8w6hLWQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/19834-kulfi-VAT-007-step-03-c2ba63bb75db4480b9a4083854178cbf.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/19834/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Freeze for 8 hours or overnight.",
